%N A400314 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = A(x^3/(1 - x)) / (1 - x)^2, with A(0) = 1.
%F A400314 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=0..floor(n/3)} binomial(n-2*k+1,k+1) * a(k).
